 following summary highlights information in this proxy statement and may not contain all the information\nthat is important to you. Accordingly, we encourage you to read carefully this entire proxy statement, its annexes and the documents referred to in this proxy statement. Each item in this summary\nincludes a page reference directing you to a more complete description of the item in this proxy statement.</I></FONT></P>\n\n<P style=\"font-family:times;\"><FONT SIZE=2>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</FONT><FONT\nSIZE=2><I>In this proxy statement, the terms \"we,\" \"us,\" \"our company,\" and \"Mac-Gray\" refer to Mac-Gray Corporation, the term \"Parent\" refers to Spin Holdco&nbsp;Inc.,\nthe term \"Merger Subsidiary\" refers to CSC Fenway,&nbsp;Inc., the term \"Holdings\" refers to CSC ServiceWorks Holdings,&nbsp;Inc., the term \"CSC\" refers to CSC ServiceWorks,&nbsp;Inc. the term\n\"Buyer Entity\" refers to any of Parent, Holdings or CSC, as applicable, the term Pamplona refers to Pamplona Capital Partners III,&nbsp;L.P. and the term \"merger agreement\" refers to the Agreement\nand Plan of Merger, dated as of October&nbsp;14, 2013, by and among Mac-Gray, Parent, Merger Subsidiary, Holdings and CSC, as it may be amended from time to time.</I></FONT></P>\n\n<P style=\"font-family:times;\"><FONT SIZE=2><A\nNAME=\"da46801_the_companies_(page_26)\"> </A>\n<A NAME=\"toc_da46801_3\"> </A>\n<BR></FONT><FONT SIZE=2><B>  The Companies (Page 26)    <BR>    </B></FONT></P>\n\n<P style=\"font-family:times;\"><FONT SIZE=2>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</FONT><FONT SIZE=2><B>Mac-Gray Corporation</B></FONT><FONT SIZE=2>, founded in 1927, is the second largest laundry facilities\nmanagement contractor in the United States. Through our portfolio of card- and\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Command exited with code 0."}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /home/uctpiaj/work && grep -n