)\n205:Table of Contents\n206:Mac-Gray Equity-Based Awards (Page 54)\n210:Consummation of the Merger\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"2:Table of Contents\n3:SUMMARY TERM SHEET\n6:The Companies (Page 26)\n8:Mac-Gray Corporation\n10:Waltham, Massachusetts 02451\n13:CSC ServiceWorks, Inc.\n15:Plainview, New York 11803\n18:CSC ServiceWorks Holdings, Inc.\n20:Plainview, New York 11803\n25:Table of Contents\n26:Spin Holdco Inc. is a Delaware corporation and a wholly-owned subsidiary of CSC.\n27:Spin Holdco Inc.\n29:Plainview, New York 11803\n32:CSC Fenway, Inc.\n34:Plainview, New York 11803\n36:The Special Meeting (Page 20)\n45:Table of Contents\n61:Mac-Gray Corporation\n63:Waltham, Massachusetts 02451\n64:Attn: Corporate Secretary\n68:Table of Contents\n70:The Merger (Page 27)\n80:Recommendation of the Mac-Gray Board of Directors (Page 45)\n85:Table of Contents\n87:Opinion of Mac-Gray's Financial Advisor (Page 45 and Annex B)\n89:Financing of the Merger (Page 58)\n92:Conditions to the Merger (Page 77)\n99:Table of Contents\n118:Non-Solicitation; Competing Acquisition Proposals (Page 69)\n125:Table of Contents\n134:Reasonable Best Efforts (Page 75)\n136:Buyer Entity Guarantees (Page 81)\n141:Table of Contents\n143:Termination of the Merger Agreement (Page 78)\n151:Parent may also terminate the merger agreement if:\n158:Mac-Gray may also terminate the merger agreement if:\n164:Table of Contents\n170:Termination Fees and Expenses (Page 79)\n173:The Voting Agreements (Page 82)\n185:Table of Contents\n187:Regulatory Matters (Page 85)\n191:Appraisal Rights (Page 85)\n193:Interests of Mac-Gray's Directors and Executive Officers in the Merger (Page 54)\n205:Table of Contents\n206:Mac-Gray Equity-Based Awards (Page 54)\n210:Consummation of the Merger\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Command exited with code 0."}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /tmp/opencode && sed -n '248,461p' filing_numbered.txt | grep -n -E '^[A-Z][A-Za-z].{0,80}$' | head -80\"}"},"time":{"start":1789824283493,"end":1789824283724}}}}
