le company (no Other-scope bids).\")\n kv(\"Non-cash consideration\", \"Party B 09/18/2013: $19.00 cash at closing plus options (10% of new equity; strike at Party B's initial cost basis; five-year vesting on base-case projections); Party B valued the options at $2.50/share for a stated package value of $21.50. Non-cash and not guaranteed; normalize before comparing with cash bids (see Q6).\")\n kv(\"Share count\", \"14,758,306 shares outstanding and entitled to vote at 11/27/2013; ≈104 holders of record; options/RSUs cashed out at closing — pp.20, 13.\")\n kv(\"Disclosed inputs not converted\", \"No net-debt, cash or enterprise-value per-share inputs are disclosed; no conversion performed. Rollover treatment: none (no rollover occurred).\")\n-kv(\"Glossary\", \"NDA = confidentiality/non-disclosure agreement. Standstill/sunset: a standstill that lapsed or allowed confidential proposals on announcement of a business combination (p.32). IOI = indication of interest. Exclusivity = exclusive negotiation agreement. Reverse termination fee = fee payable by the buyer side on specified termination (here $15M if regulatory clearance is not obtained). Go-shop = post-signing solicitation period; none here. Rollover = a shareholder contributing shares into the buyer instead of cashing out; none occurred.\"))\n+kv(\"Glossary\", \"NDA = confidentiality/non-disclosure agreement. Standstill/sunset: a standstill that lapsed or allowed confidential proposals on announcement of a business combination (p.32). IOI = indication of interest. Exclusivity = exclusive negotiation agreement. Reverse termination fee = fee payable by the buyer side on specified termination (here $15M if regulatory clearance is not obtained). Go-shop = post-signing solicitation period; none here. Rollover = a shareholder contributing shares into the buyer instead of cashing out; none occurred.\")\n \n # ---------------------------------------------------------------- Questions sheet\n qs = wb.create_sheet(\"Questions\")\n qc = [\"Q\",\"Review topic\",\"Recommended answer\",\"Why and source\",\"Affected rows/fields\",\"Consequence of changing it\",\"Status\",\"Reviewer note\"]\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited /tmp/opencode/build_workbook.py (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\": \"kv(\\\"Glossary\\\", \\\"NDA = confidentiality/non-disclosure agreement. Standstill/sunset: a standstill that lapsed or allowed confidential proposals on announcement of a business combination (p.32). IOI = indication of interest. Exclusivity = exclusive negotiation agreement. Reverse termination fee = fee payable by the buyer side on specified termination (here $15M if regulatory clearance is not obtained). Go-shop = post-signing solicitation period; none here. Rollover = a shareholder contributing shares into the buyer instead of cashing out; none occurred.\\\")\", \"oldString\": \"kv(\\\"Glossary\\\", \\\"NDA = confidentiality/non-disclosure agreement. Standstill/sunset: a standstill that lapsed or allowed confidential proposals on announcement of a business combination (p.32). IOI = indication of interest. Exclusivity = exclusive negotiation agreement. Reverse termination fee = fee payable by the buyer side on specified termination (here $15M if regulatory clearance is not obtained). Go-shop = post-signing solicitation period; none here. Rollover = a shareholder contributing shares into the buyer instead of cashing out; none occurred.\\\"))\", \"path\": \"/tmp/opencode/build_workbook.py\"}"},"time":{"start":1789824990709,"end":1789824991468}}}}
