$100,\"Contact\",'Deal ledger'!$P$2:$P$100,\"Yes\") || NOTE: Equals 51: the 50-party wave plus the 04/08/2013 Party A contact (R003); Party A is also i\n[44] 'NDAs — filing assertion'                    | 20 signers: 2 strategic + 18 financial (p.32).\n[45] 'NDAs — ledger sum'                          | =SUMIFS('Deal ledger'!$Q$2:$Q$100,'Deal ledger'!$D$2:$D$100,\"NDA signed\",'Deal ledger'!$P$2:$P$100,\"Yes\") || NOTE: Equals 20 and matches the filing: individually recorded Party B R015, Party C R016, CSC/Pa\n[46] 'Round-bidder tallies'                       | Round 1: 4 units — R020 CSC/Pamplona, R022 Party B, R023 Party C, plus Party A's standing R010 proposal shown \n[47] 'Submissions — ledger counts'                | Bid rows and Bid reaffirmed rows are formula-counted below; by bidder: Party A 3 priced communications (R010, \n[48] 'Bid rows'                                   | =COUNTIFS('Deal ledger'!$D$2:$D$100,\"Bid\",'Deal ledger'!$P$2:$P$100,\"Yes\") || NOTE: Equals 11 Bid rows (submissions, not unique bidders).\n[49] 'Bid reaffirmed rows'                        | =COUNTIFS('Deal ledger'!$D$2:$D$100,\"Bid reaffirmed\",'Deal ledger'!$P$2:$P$100,\"Yes\") || NOTE: Equals 1: Party A best-and-final reiteration R038.\n[50] 'Per-stage balance'                          | Stage 1 (R1): 20 entrants − 0 stated exits − 16 inferred exits = 4 continuing. Stage 2 (R2): 4 − 0 − 0 = 4. St\n[51] 'Outcome occurrences'                        | Did not submit: 2 rows covering 17 units (16 inferred residual + Party C stated). Dropped by target: 2 rows co\n[52] 'Auction screen'                             | MET — more than one independent prospective acquiring bidder unit executed bidder-target confidentiality agree\n[53] 'Bounds and uncertainty'                     | The 16-residual base assumes all residual signers had signed by and were eligible for the 07/23/2013 solicitat\n[54] 'Comparability and inputs'                   | None\n[55] 'Currency and scope'                   